// <auto-generated>
// Engine-owned ProcGen parity harness (ENG-10). Compiles the engine-owned
// gameplay SDK source (EngineGameplay.cs, produced by
// `sandbox project sync-script-api`) together with this file and checks the
// managed Engine.ProcGen port against the checked-in golden vectors shared
// with the Rust engine-procgen tests:
